  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "My model has 32 (64 is the limit for Green) transforms and 7 components, I'd like it if I could add more components than 8 (The Limit for Green Avatars) to make up for that. I'm sure other people have the same problem with their avatars. I'd like to stay within the optimized range.",
